@kraftverk/integration-icloud

Ported to TypeScript from:

- Home Assistant's `icloud` integration
  (https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/icloud),
  Copyright the Home Assistant authors, licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0.
- pyicloud (https://github.com/timlaing/pyicloud, and the project it
  continues, https://github.com/picklepete/pyicloud), licensed under the MIT
  License: Copyright (c) 2013 Peter Evans, and its contributors.
- pysrp (https://github.com/cocagne/pysrp), licensed under the MIT License:
  Copyright (c) 2010 Tom Cocagne.

Changed: rewritten in TypeScript for kraftverk — the SRP client as pysrp
computes it with RFC 5054's padding and no username in x; the sign-in,
second factor, trust and account login as pyicloud makes them; Find My's
calls. No code was copied verbatim.

